# Tools CI and contributors run (tests, lint, types, audit). Keep the dev list in sync with
# [project.optional-dependencies].dev in pyproject.toml; a unit test checks it.
# requirements-dev.txt is generated from this file; do not edit it by hand:
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --strip-extras --allow-unsafe -o requirements-dev.txt requirements-dev.in
#
# The runtime set is constrained to the exact pins of requirements.txt, so CI tests the same
# dependency versions the image ships.
-c requirements.txt
-r requirements.in
